--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
[2] model_tflite.cpp — TFLite Model Data (Training Dataset: EdgeImpulse)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The int8-quantized 1D-CNN model embedded in src/tinyml_main/model_tflite.cpp was
trained on the "Continuous motion recognition" dataset published by
EdgeImpulse Inc.

    Dataset name: Continuous motion recognition
    Source:       https://docs.edgeimpulse.com/datasets/time-series/continuous-motion-recognition
    Copyright:    EdgeImpulse Inc.
    License:      The Clear BSD License (SPDX: BSD-3-Clause-Clear)

The model was self-built (no Edge Impulse proprietary SDK code is included in
this sample); only the training dataset is subject to the license below. The
embedded binary is a derivative work of the dataset.

